---
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="border-t border-line">
  <div class="mx-auto flex max-w-6xl flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-6 px-4 py-10 text-sm text-muted sm:px-6">
    <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
      <img src="/logo.svg" alt="" width="18" height="24" class="h-6 w-auto" />
      <span>&copy; {year} Picavet IT, Kenny Picavet</span>
    </div>
    <p>
      Built with Astro and Claude Code, every line reviewed by me.
      <a href="https://github.com/kpicavet/portfolio-picavet-it" class="text-ink underline underline-offset-4" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Source on GitHub</a>
    </p>
  </div>
</footer>
